    "notes": "Launch the system Files app through the bundle metadata-confirmed com.huawei.hmos.files/EntryAbility, receive its initial semantic layout before interaction, then issue one manifest-owned Back action to return to NextN. This is read-only and does not open, rename, move, delete, share, or create any file."
